---
// The prose on this page is placeholder copy — rewrite it as your own. It is
// intentionally *not* in `src/i18n/`: the dictionary holds UI chrome, so a
// translator isn't handed someone else's biography, and you don't have to open
// a dictionary file to edit your own about page.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../consts';
import { t } from '../../i18n';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={t('about.title')}
  description={`About the author behind this ${SITE.title} site.`}
>
  <section class="page-head section">
    <p class="eyebrow">{t('about.eyebrow')}</p>
    <h1>Who I am.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      I am a self-taught IT and Cybersecurity practitioner, based in Southern California. I am DoD 8140 IAT Level II certified, 
      having passed the CISSP to become an Associate of ISC2 as well as the CompTIA CySA+ exam.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Background</p>
      <h2>//</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose-stack">
      <p>
        I have hands-on experience with a multitude of platforms covering Windows Active Directory 
        and Microsoft 365 environments, as well as Linux and macOS, identity and access management, endpoint configuration and 
        management, ITSM platforms and systems hardening, built through a mixture of practical lab work and 
        professional experience.
      </p>
      <p>
        Understanding how systems fail and how they're exploited allows me to be effective at 
        maintaining them. I resolve problems fast, escalate with coherent context, and catch issues that 
        might be overlooked without a strong security perspective.
      </p>
      <p>
      I also understand IT and Cybersecurity exist to keep people productive in a safe and efficient 
      environment, allowing the organization to flourish. As an effective practitioner, I am able to 
      bridge the gap between IT and Cybersecurity to communicate to both technical and non-technical 
      people.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-label={t('about.ledgerLabel')}>
    <div class="about-ledger">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Current focus</h3>
        <p>Binary analysis, UEBA as a metric in AI-augmented monitoring, and network engineering.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Motto</h3>
        <p>
          When in doubt, read the friendly manual.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Contact</h3>
        <p>
          Reach me through Email or LinkedIn.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose-grid about-closing">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Hobbies</p>
      <h2></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose-stack">
      <p>
        I love wildlife and nature. I enjoy offering my services to non-profits whenever possible 
        and helping them maintain their organizations to be able to effectively carry out their missions.
      </p>
      <p>
        If I'm not reading documentation or articles about various forms of technology, I enjoy 
        listening to music and exercising.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
